dding: 0px;display: block;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\"><strong style=\"caret-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);padding:0px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;color:rgb(102, 102, 102);letter-spacing:0.5px;font-size:14px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;line-height:24px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><span style=\"border-radius:5px;background-color:rgb(171, 219, 171);padding:4px 10px;margin:0px 8px 0px 0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">&nbsp;槽边往事</span></span></strong><span style=\"caret-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);padding:0px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;color:rgb(127, 127, 127);letter-spacing:0.5px;font-size:14px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;line-height:24px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">和菜头 出品</span></strong></span></p>\n         <p style=\"caret-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);padding:0px;margin:0px;display:block;letter-spacing:0.544px;font-size:15px;min-height:1.5em;line-height:1.75em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;max-width:100%;word-break:normal;font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;line-height: 24px;color: rgb(127, 127, 127);letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\